## What it does

A set of LLM features built into tools a content team already uses: draft
suggestions, automated reporting, and plain-language search.

## Approach

Shipped against the OpenAI API with careful prompt design and guardrails, then
measured on real usage so each feature saved time instead of adding noise.

## Impact

Cut repetitive manual work for the content team and became part of their daily
workflow.
